{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/769609-scion-players-wanted-looking-for-game","id":769609,"title":"Scion: Players Wanted/Looking For Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-19T16:04:54-08:00","id":769609,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Scion: Players Wanted/Looking For Game","content":"(I am sorry if this is the wrong place. It seemed appropriate, as well as needed.)<br /> <br /> List your needs and links here:<br /> <br /> 2 willing players available. (Both played locally, however the game seemed half-baked sometimes.) We are somewhat new, just not by much. I play in character, hard. I play the role that is most needed, even if not understood. She plays a great diplomat, where I fail. LOL","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9511-sirlol","name":"SirLOL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9511_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T16:29:25-08:00","id":769619,"title":"","content":"There is a section on the forums where people hold games. It's in the Conventions, Gatherings and Online Play section, then the Play By Post.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post\"> Play by Post - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> For playing roleplaying games on the forums. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I just got Hero and Demigod yesterday, so I'm new to the game too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T16:55:11-08:00","id":769637,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1394_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1394\" data-vbnamecard=\"1394\">Nyrufa</a> Thanks for your post, I suppose I cant move this over there can I? Meh. My first character was a Nord, very traditional, did everything with all his might, including opening doors! etc. He did build his mother a new home worthy of his strength. Probably considered a fortress. Boulders that wont break and thick enough where he cant brake the walls. Mjord The Crusher was his name. Very polite and unassuming, even if he did stick out by his size and work out routine, to lift things that where a challenge every morning...bench pressing the stolen military grade Hummer got old. LOL. I kinda miss him, it was kinda catchy. People used his phrases even after I had long left. He wasn't stupid, he just didn't do what Americans do, with all there soft and squishy, weak goods, tools etc. He didn't mind following orders. If you asked him to throw you the tire, you better know what your asking. Ask him to push the car, you better hope its well made. etc LOL","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9511-sirlol","name":"SirLOL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9511_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T17:53:20-08:00","id":769678,"title":"","content":"Sounds like an amusing guy who has no concept of doorknobs.<br /> <br /> As I said, I only got the game yesterday and am still reading through Hero, so I haven't made any characters myself. The fact I have pretty much zero knowledge of appropriate names for any of these foreign cultures is a bit frustrating to me. I want to make an Amatsukami character, but don't know what an appropriate Japanese name might be. Same with Aesir, Atzlanti, or Pesedjet, it's hard to think of names that might fit their scions. Though I suppose I could look up Scandanavian names for the Aesir.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-01-2015, 11:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T16:13:15-08:00","id":770363,"title":"","content":"I used Skyrim and a leaping post for my nord name. Doorknobs, he crushes doorknobs. I knew a doorknob once. Doorknobs, he crushes doorknobs...LOL","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9511-sirlol","name":"SirLOL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9511_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T09:15:28-08:00","id":770776,"title":"","content":"Technically, they're called the Norse, they're only Nord in Elder Scrolls. But yeah, they pretty much have the same culture.<br /> <br /> I suppose I could just <a href=\"http://fantasynamegenerators.com/\" target=\"_blank\">use this</a> for coming up with names. I just realized scrolling down that it has real names (Greek, Japanese, Viking, Egyptian, African, Aztec, est) as well as fantasy names. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T04:53:10-08:00","id":772960,"title":"","content":"Woot, yes, get r done! LOL Yes its difficult coming up with real names. I never worry about it as long as it sounds fitting, and rhythmic. or was it harmonic? LOL Ironically i end up finding some simulance to a allot of my characters names included to some person in history.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9511-sirlol","name":"SirLOL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9511_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T15:03:48-08:00","id":773453,"title":"","content":"So I just finished reading most of Scion: Hero, with the minor exceptions of the combat system and The Long Road to Heaven.<br /> <br /> Once I read through the story, I'm going to read Demigod and continue the series.<br /> <br /> <br /> Sure are a lot of boobs in these books! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}